{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24906","headline":"太学创置石经 · 薛存诚","name":"太学创置石经","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣唐复古制，德义功无替。\n奥旨悦诗书，遗文分篆隶。\n银钩互交映，石壁靡尘翳。\n永与乾坤期，不逐日月逝。\n儒林道益广，学者心弥锐。\n从此理化成，恩光遍遐裔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛存诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}